# TBMC — Commission 06B.4: Permanent Room 815 UNICORN Integration

**Project:** TmoGit/TBMC-Deploy  
**Organization:** Acropolis Engineers  
**Target:** Gene Therapy-815 / AVA25  
**OPC connection:** Unicorn-2  
**Instrument:** Avant3119961  
**Predecessors:** Commission 06B, 06B.1, 06B.2 and 06B.3  
**Execution:** Permanent commissioning configuration  
**Final disposition:** Leave equipment and process tags enabled

## 1. Objective

Complete the permanent OPC integration of all six existing chromatography process parameters for the Room 815 AVA25 equipment instance.

Previous commissions have demonstrated OPC authentication, parameter addressing and end-to-end graphical data transport.

This commission shall complete the equipment configuration and leave it enabled for ongoing monitoring and subsequent live instrument verification.

Instrument availability is not a prerequisite for configuring independently verified OPC addresses.

This commission supersedes previous instructions requiring temporary enablement or restoration of disabled process tags at commission completion.

